Dark mode consistency

All pages in this branch receive themeMode and setThemeMode props (not dark/setDark). The value is either 'light' or 'dark'. Apply the theme by setting a class on the page wrapper:

<div className={`page-wrapper ${themeMode === 'dark' ? 'dark' : ''}`}>

The CSS variables for dark mode are already defined in src/css/theme.css. Do not add new CSS variables — use the existing ones.

Translation (i18n)

